+# TLS certificate verification
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification is enabled on all builds, development builds included, so it is never disabled for development. This is reinforced by the recorded rule of HTTPS everywhere with no exceptions, which means plain HTTP is not used, including for internal hosts.
